      "id": 106765,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-18T21:23:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><em>Can Fanatic die in the middle of an End of Days?</em></p><p>Yep, anything that triggers on destruction interrupts the End of Days and you deal with that effect 'now', which could kill her (or end the game in Akash's case).</p><p><em>Would it wipe out EoD?</em></p><p>I don't see why not, all cards belonging to a character are removed, no matter where they are (as previously clarified by the under-La-Capitan incap situation).</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:36:46.643Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
