      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p><em>Can Fanatic die in the middle of an End of Days?</em></p><p>Yep, anything that triggers on destruction interrupts the End of Days and you deal with that effect &#39;now&#39;, which could kill her (or end the game in Akash&#39;s case).</p><p><em>Would it wipe out EoD?</em></p><p>I don&#39;t see why not, all cards belonging to a character are removed, no matter where they are (as previously clarified by the under-La-Capitan incap situation).</p>",
